What We have to do: We have to create an Amazon Nav-Bar with the following rules:

 1. The Nar-Bar color and height are: #0f1111 , 60px.

 2. Their is a white border around with a width of 6px.

 3. Within the Nar-Bar ,there are four link tags each apart by 200px named: Amazon.in, Account, My Cart, Contact Us.
    With the tags, there is a Search-Bar with a bottom alongside.

 4. The Background-color of the button is #f08804 with white as the text color. 

 5. The text-sie within this nav-bar should be 25px. 

 6. Within the search-bar, their should be text as:  Search Amazon.ca.

 If you want, you can add more speacific elements and their properties to this project. 

 What I did extra:
  1. I picked the same font-family from offical Amazon sitation.
  2. Some more but your task is to figure it out if you want. Or it's just fine. 
